Yomira
https://github.com/MathisVerstrepen/komikku-suwayomi

Yomira is an independent Android client for Suwayomi-Server, forked from Komikku.
It is not an official release of Komikku, Mihon, TachiyomiSY, Tachiyomi, or Suwayomi.

This work includes software derived from:
- Komikku: https://github.com/komikku-app/komikku
- Mihon: https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon
- TachiyomiSY: https://github.com/jobobby04/TachiyomiSY
- Tachiyomi and its contributors

Server functionality is provided by Suwayomi-Server:
https://github.com/Suwayomi/Suwayomi-Server

Original copyright, attribution, and license notices remain in LICENSE,
source files, dependency license records, and repository history.
The original Komikku contribution and fork guide is preserved at
docs/UPSTREAM_KOMIKKU_CONTRIBUTING.md.

The Yomira Yo panel icon is new artwork for this fork. Retained Komikku artwork
identifies and credits the original project; it does not identify Yomira releases.

The architecture illustration identifies Suwayomi and Sorayomi using their
project logos, Copyright Contributors to the Suwayomi project. See
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and .github/readme-images/yomira/architecture-LICENSE.txt
for illustration attribution and licensing.
